  "bodyHash": "0cbbd57246612576",
  "content": "<h2>此模组為原版無法製作的物品添加了配方，請查看圖片以了解配方。</h2>\n<p>強烈建議您使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frei%252fversion%252f18.0.804%2bfabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items (REI)</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmine-spawners%252fversion%252faMAMQxLy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mine Spawners</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fobtainable-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obtainable End</a>，或是我的另一個模組 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbreakable-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Breakable Blocks</a>。</p>\n&lt;center&gt; \n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aada0ab88dd3aec82e2a9b6cc1a0707f38a8118b.png\" alt=\"title\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>生怪蛋配方</h1>\n<p>所有生怪蛋均可製作，您可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fcraft-spawn-eggs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Craft Spawn Eggs</a> 中查看相同的配方。</p>\n<h3>終界龍生怪蛋</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5fe3102c6f9c94af9df9758a8864427ac0a10f41.jpeg\" alt=\"ed\"></p>\n<h3>凋靈生怪蛋</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9be66dd9aab0feec9f29be61274edaaea9574633.png\" alt=\"ww\"></p>\n<h3>銅傀儡生怪蛋</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c5cbf88d2a06acc6a3d87269f183cc30072ac97b.jpeg\" alt=\"copper golem\"></p>\n<h3>駱駝皮革生怪蛋</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/354fc19f2345de41595ccd3fa3a2b2b2abe76e73.jpeg\" alt=\"Camel Husk\"></p>\n<h3>乾燥靈魂生怪蛋</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/047c71a30799cc01cd4803ac0f2b9197734417c8.jpeg\" alt=\"parched\"></p>\n<h3>鸚鵡螺殼生怪蛋</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c08c454b9dee5ea1fa1b1a79740a571fa97e663f.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus\"></p>\n<h3>鸚鵡螺殭屍生怪蛋</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6d319afaa6d8f417d5f18cd66bcca44ef1bcda93.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus Z\"></p>\n<h1>物品與方塊</h1>\n<h3>不死图腾</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/84807850dd73232807b42ad3bfb7f1b136ffdd1f.png\" alt=\"totem\"></p>\n<h3>怪物刷怪籠</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1bcc3f4033071380475cf4b2872f6133ee66ba66.png\" alt=\"spawner\"></p>\n<h3>附魔金蘋果</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/70ecc176db1f79dfa15ec43faa7d37cc6293dd60.png\" alt=\"ega\"></p>\n<h3>馬鞍</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/339c9ce6d4ac65de9225937a6a6c37bbb67d2e2e.png\" alt=\"saddle\"></p>\n<h3>鞘翅</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6a8e867bcec7364a48eff4c76a90c799ef9679f3.png\" alt=\"elytra\"></p>\n<h3>命名牌</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/167926d00a5f785ac6bf17b0969107dde6dd2998.png\" alt=\"Name Tag\">!</p>\n<h3>三叉戟</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5b6f89594f7c95fa98200b981647baa066467e68.png\" alt=\"tr\"></p>\n<h3>傳送門框架</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af5ea409836e2281d9828da40ed4667d89587f41.png\" alt=\"end\"></p>\n<h1>馬鎧甲</h1>\n<h3>皮革</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c3f0ec052aaf228a5095670c46689ecd85473f00.png\" alt=\"l\"></p>\n<h3>鐵</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/94d26a73f8a7bd5388a7421266b180d44169f1a9.png\" alt=\"i\"></p>\n<h3>銅</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/27d538f6112de59a5e1f9799f56b78734ad4d37a.jpeg\" alt=\"copper horse\"></p>\n<h3>金</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4876047c5c27038997716c89729837143aa95555.png\" alt=\"g\"></p>\n<h3>鑽石</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/056605790622f9fa71cee068916b3557a9271561.png\" alt=\"d\"></p>\n<h1>鸚鵡螺鎧甲</h1>\n<h3>鐵</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f4807c7e8b5e31c4404db1ca8e076c743ada1e1b_0.webp\" alt=\"nautilus iron\"></p>\n<h3>銅</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c43313ba71215a18e9377c0b1f4d9f5ea5ea8f50.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus copper\"></p>\n<h3>金</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f6e85460100d5ade67b44a7377ce2c5ecfde6b80.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus gold\"></p>\n<h3>鑽石</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f6a06ffa6aea504102587d7153b0f90e501bca71.jpeg\" alt=\"nautilus d\"></p>\n<h1>鎖鏈鎧甲</h1>\n<h3>鎖鏈</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e924f8202f9f6c86fac8d5f7bd46d09c9008d469.png\" alt=\"c\"></p>\n<h3>頭盔</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a4fe0bfe3f150b5d5ca6614be4ee9e23c62feddb.png\" alt=\"h\"></p>\n<h3>胸甲</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aad186ee5ac469fa1898dc8990e09b8d8ea043f.png\" alt=\"c\"></p>\n<h3>護腿</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8381e5828c720f60520cc17fc67b7a8ce63c8662.png\" alt=\"l\"></p>\n<h3>靴子</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/de70e6fa559f5717bdfcb66731e9d1cfb14adf99.png\" alt=\"b\"></p>\n<h1>下界合金</h1>\n<h3>下界合金升級</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1337a69ccdd8ac0f8a74639daa1e4df78a471dbb.png\" alt=\"n1\"></p>\n<h3>劍</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3ac1be519ff7b1e6b1577a28a1e4bbf9e770d5d3.png\" alt=\"n2\"></p>\n<h3>鏟</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0a3b824ebb494a986c56405d4dc234bb7ccde11d.png\" alt=\"n3\"></p>\n<h3>鎬</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e863dc945f77d1d66025c0dc9093d639765b281a.png\" alt=\"n4\"></p>\n<h3>斧</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/51a7d0f98b00e84a83b1c479e944a6227adfef2b.png\" alt=\"n5\"></p>\n<h3>鋤</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c6edcde7f132dce5841b46764121c046c5a360b.png\" alt=\"n6\"></p>\n<h3>頭盔</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8d5989c6df493023a3f1e617b7559ffb128e77.png\" alt=\"n7\"></p>\n<h3>胸甲</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/75749b034fb9b50e42ea5dd7204b0c68e62a170e.png\" alt=\"n8\"></p>\n<h3>護腿</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1aabb8d2e55d8c4b8fe438beb1ecb4aadce5eb41.png\" alt=\"n9\"></p>\n<h3>靴子</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5e3c331db00b3b4a96f06a065adf199a10e77607.png\" alt=\"n10\"></p>",
